# Xilfflix — Environment Variables

## Server-side (Vercel / Node)
# TMDB Read Access Token — never exposed to the browser.
# Set this in Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Locally, add it to .env.local (gitignored).
TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_tmdb_read_access_token_here

# Supabase Configuration (Required for Watch With Friends & Auth)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

## Note: All TMDB API calls are routed through the /api/tmdb serverless proxy.
## No TMDB key is ever embedded in the client-side JavaScript bundle.
